{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5859656e0c7ddae786565695308451257c48af04546202bb7a9abff6ae37c3b2","ja":"この前の屋外ライブ、楽しかったね♪\nみんなで食べたお弁当も、すごく美味しかったな～！","zh":"之前那场户外演出好开心呀♪\n大家一起吃的便当也超级美味呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1dca87214a5cb067a816c2d410eaf96cf6c3663902681053c26a58e47ed38a0c","ja":"うん！　そろそろ桜も散っちゃいそうだけど、\nもう1回くらい、お花見したいよね！","zh":"嗯！虽然樱花差不多也快落了，\n但还想再去赏个1次花呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"91a788bc9e479f913987010270d906d61972e794ae67fcf8ed77012ee5b05f07","ja":"今シーズン最後かぁ……。\nそれなら、最っ高に盛り上げたいよな！","zh":"本赛季最后一次了吗……。\n既然这样，那就一定要炒热到最棒的气氛啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"133ccfd2253a28e3a4b9d66c89862e9bb7504685abb9a03b2415a108b6bf1390","ja":"それなら、●●●●プロデューサーも誘おうよ！","zh":"既然这样，那就把●●●●制作人也叫上吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"db50308878ad4f1fb311ab2149339450a96e115dc6e8e589a247c8c775ce3575","ja":"今、めちゃくちゃ忙しそうだから、\n気分転換にもなるんじゃないかな！","zh":"现在看起来非常忙，\n正好也能转换一下心情吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0a8c95cee74fe00c3cddb975b782681d58c4082bbedcdbf044168ad2d1728bde","ja":"それなら、少し遠出して桜の名所に行く……\nなんていうのもいいかもしれませんね。","zh":"既然这样，稍微跑远一点去赏樱胜地……\n感觉也是个不错的选择呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f06f9aedea6b715201df2c6a5f05fcda71fb7fb6926addaa40cf7ecf36d087a4","ja":"うん。のんびりお出かけなんて、\nすごくほっとできそう……♪","zh":"嗯。要是能悠闲地出趟门，\n感觉会非常安心呢……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"959fc86d15ed287521062ea22e3e8d2a670a929ee8dc04c3bc22e2229c312fdf","ja":"じゃあ今から場所の候補しぼって、\n●●●●プロデューサーに提案してみようよ！","zh":"那现在就来筛选候补地点，\n试着向●●●●制作人提议吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"45e21dee86bbab0205979ced95dc025954b163a25c211119d36896aa3c29986c","ja":"そして、数十分後……","zh":"然后，数十分钟后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25","ja":"う～ん……。","zh":"嗯……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"1e3d76cd1efd317cb16c063df4bce2dfc2e57d0653b1d74948cc97d4f775c35e","ja":"あ、昴、●●●●プロデューサーの返事どうだった？","zh":"啊，昂，●●●●制作人怎么回复的？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1173.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"2e3042d92318229ec93b53e0505760d4e2aba3e82691e6717ef6f3eabb435792","ja":"それが……仕事が忙しいから、\nお花見は難しいかも、って……。","zh":"说是……因为工作太忙，\n可能很难去赏花了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
